OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FA Virgin Atlantic engineer died after
OL,8,Fsuffering a traumatic brain injury
OL,9,Fwhen he was hit in the face in an
OL,10,Fincident at Heathrow Airport, a
OL,11,Fcoroners' court has heard.
OL,13,FAircraft technician Georgie Buxton,
OL,14,F23, was injured on June 11 and died at
OL,15,FSt Mary's Hospital on July 7.
OL,17,FSenior coroner Lydia Brown opened and
OL,18,Fsuspended an inquest into his death at
OL,19,FWest London Coroners' Court on
OL,20,FThursday as she is waiting to see if
OL,21,Fany criminal charges are brought.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
