FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FMrs Brown said a forensic post-mortem
OL,8,Fexamination found Mr Buxton had
OL,9,Fsuffered a traumatic brain injury ` a
OL,10,Fcraniofacial trauma.
OL,12,FShe said: "There was an accident at
OL,13,FGeorgie's place of work.
OL,15,F"He took a trauma to the face causing
OL,16,Fhim complex and tragically fatal
OL,17,Finjuries.
OL,19,F"He did undergo various surgeries in
OL,20,Fhospital but these were not able to
OL,21,Fsave life.
OL,26,@tD@KOUwD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
