OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,F"He died on 7 July 2026 following the
OL,8,Fincident that took place on 11 June
OL,9,F2026."
OL,11,FA criminal investigation has been
OL,12,Flaunched by the Metropolitan Police
OL,13,Fwho are working with the Health and
OL,14,FSafety Executive.
OL,16,FThe coroner said she had no details of
OL,17,Fany potential charges.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@FO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
