OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FOfficers were called at 8.49am on June
OL,8,F11 to reports that a man had been
OL,9,Finjured at Heathrow Airport, the Met
OL,10,Fsaid on Tuesday.
OL,12,FA Virgin Atlantic spokesman said in a
OL,13,Fstatement on Tuesday: "We are
OL,14,Fheartbroken to confirm that a much-
OL,15,Floved member of our engineering team
OL,16,Fhas passed away.
OL,18,F"Our thoughts are firmly with
OL,19,FGeorgie's family, loved ones, friends
OL,20,Fand colleagues at this incredibly sad
OL,21,Fand challenging time.
OL,26,@uD@WOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,F"We're providing support to loved ones
OL,8,Fwherever we can and sharing our
OL,9,Fheartfelt condolences to everyone
OL,10,Faffected.
OL,12,F"Georgie's family has asked for
OL,13,Fprivacy at this very difficult time."
OL,15,FThe spokesman added: "The safety and
OL,16,Fwellbeing of our people is always our
OL,17,Ftop priority, and we are devastated by
OL,18,Fthis incident.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUuD@eO]wD@VOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
