OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785410316
OL,3,CAircraft engineer died of brain injury
OL,4,Cafter incident at Heathrow, inquest
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,F"We are working closely with relevant
OL,8,Fauthorities and the aircraft
OL,9,Fmanufacturer on the investigation to
OL,10,Festablish all facts.
OL,12,F"Out of respect for those involved and
OL,13,Fwhile the investigation is ongoing, we
OL,14,Fare unable to provide any further
OL,15,Finformation at this stage."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@[O]
